    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich or die! Supernatural Squad is a terrifying yet thrilling co-op multiplayer adventure game. Valuable treasures await, but to claim them, you'll need to team up with friends and face terrifying monsters. Don\u2019t forget your Supernatural Survival Guide. Good luck, and may fortune favor you in your treasure hunt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/4bf589c4f01a4279d3b5af94089dd8e8.poster.avif?t=1737631704\" width=594 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/4bf589c4f01a4279d3b5af94089dd8e8.webm?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/4bf589c4f01a4279d3b5af94089dd8e8.mp4?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with three friends to embark on a perilous journey to mysterious ancient ruins, uncover priceless treasures, and bring them back to get rich. Upgrade your gear and venture into even more dangerous ruins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/af77529388f67958ec8e339321ce4bae.poster.avif?t=1737631704\" width=594 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/af77529388f67958ec8e339321ce4bae.webm?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/af77529388f67958ec8e339321ce4bae.mp4?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter terrifying ancient monsters like the Ghost Bride and Marionette, face deadly traps, and even get lost in mind-bending mazes! Every step could be your last, so use your gear wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/56d1ed912d6e1d0f36dd9b381e7c55e6.poster.avif?t=1737631704\" width=594 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/56d1ed912d6e1d0f36dd9b381e7c55e6.webm?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/56d1ed912d6e1d0f36dd9b381e7c55e6.mp4?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with your allies to overcome challenges and escape the ruins with treasures before nightfall. But be careful\u2014don\u2019t mistake Alternates for teammates, and watch out for those slackers who might drag the team down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/378426572b3d8d5af4283fd36782019e.poster.avif?t=1737631704\" width=594 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/378426572b3d8d5af4283fd36782019e.webm?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/378426572b3d8d5af4283fd36782019e.mp4?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game features the following:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four-player online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying ancient monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spooked friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky dance moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plentiful useful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historic and mysterious treasures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/293c6f0541d587c75b3ce2b745b4b279.poster.avif?t=1737631704\" width=594 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/293c6f0541d587c75b3ce2b745b4b279.webm?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/293c6f0541d587c75b3ce2b745b4b279.mp4?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a blast, and don't become a statistic!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich or die! Supernatural Squad is a terrifying yet thrilling co-op multiplayer adventure game. Valuable treasures await, but to claim them, you'll need to team up with friends and face terrifying monsters. Don\u2019t forget your Supernatural Survival Guide. Good luck, and may fortune favor you in your treasure hunt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/4bf589c4f01a4279d3b5af94089dd8e8.poster.avif?t=1737631704\" width=594 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/4bf589c4f01a4279d3b5af94089dd8e8.webm?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/4bf589c4f01a4279d3b5af94089dd8e8.mp4?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with three friends to embark on a perilous journey to mysterious ancient ruins, uncover priceless treasures, and bring them back to get rich. Upgrade your gear and venture into even more dangerous ruins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/af77529388f67958ec8e339321ce4bae.poster.avif?t=1737631704\" width=594 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/af77529388f67958ec8e339321ce4bae.webm?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/af77529388f67958ec8e339321ce4bae.mp4?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter terrifying ancient monsters like the Ghost Bride and Marionette, face deadly traps, and even get lost in mind-bending mazes! Every step could be your last, so use your gear wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/56d1ed912d6e1d0f36dd9b381e7c55e6.poster.avif?t=1737631704\" width=594 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/56d1ed912d6e1d0f36dd9b381e7c55e6.webm?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/56d1ed912d6e1d0f36dd9b381e7c55e6.mp4?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with your allies to overcome challenges and escape the ruins with treasures before nightfall. But be careful\u2014don\u2019t mistake Alternates for teammates, and watch out for those slackers who might drag the team down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/378426572b3d8d5af4283fd36782019e.poster.avif?t=1737631704\" width=594 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/378426572b3d8d5af4283fd36782019e.webm?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/378426572b3d8d5af4283fd36782019e.mp4?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game features the following:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four-player online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying ancient monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spooked friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky dance moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plentiful useful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historic and mysterious treasures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/293c6f0541d587c75b3ce2b745b4b279.poster.avif?t=1737631704\" width=594 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/293c6f0541d587c75b3ce2b745b4b279.webm?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302740/extras/293c6f0541d587c75b3ce2b745b4b279.mp4?t=1737631704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a blast, and don't become a statistic!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into a spine-tingling and exhilarating multiplayer adventure rooted in Chinese horror folklore. Team up to explore millennia-old ruins filled with lost treasures\u2014but beware! Deadly monsters and mythical creatures lurk in every shadow.",
